    <string name="home_setup_does_the_rest_itself_it">Setup does the rest itself: it downloads the toolkit into Termux and installs the few command-line tools it needs.\n\nThis one step it cannot do. Android does not let one app change another app\'s settings, so you have to allow commands from other apps inside Termux. Copy the line below, paste it into Termux, and press Enter. You only do this once.</string>
